# Purpose of this Repo

This repository contains the ressources for the [FlightGear Mirage 2000](https://github.com/5H1N0B11/flightgear-mirage2000). These ressources are e.g. original 3D files (Blender .blend), originals images (GIMP .xcf), etc.

Cf. the readme files in the subfolders for specific contents and instructions.

# License

Cf. file `LICENSE` at the root of the directory.

The license has been changed from GPL-3 to GPL-2 in summer 2026, because it was not alinged with the license of the product ([FlightGear Mirage 2000](https://github.com/5H1N0B11/flightgear-mirage2000)) and because it was not intended as GPL-2. All previous contributors have given their accept for the license change in the Discord channel: `hardball` gave a thumbs-up on December 20 2025, Wolf on December 31 2025 and 5H1N0B1 on March 27 2026.
